-## The overlay (`D`, PP_DEBUG builds only)
-
-The briefing's user-approved list, mapped onto the stream: per-pipe readout (on
-select), per-class table (demand/delivered/dropped/loss%/avg ms/SLA), congestion
-heat (pipes tinted by util% — ladder <50 clear / 50-69 amber / 70-89 orange / ≥90
