+# node_health.dem — Story 5.2: the per-node HEALTH states (the GDD M5 primary
+# warning surface — the tri-state telegraph the player reads at a glance).
+# Era 3 + growth on (5.1 coherence): the connected legs (res->router) flow
+# email from tick 3; the HOST pipe is DELAYED to 20s so the host's streaming
+# spawns pile (the drowning case — amber at 2 stuck = 75% of the 80 u/s host
+# throughput, red at 4+ = 150%); growth spawns content_hosts the player has
+# NOT connected — their streaming piles too (the "growth-born nodes included"
+# canon). The telegraph is icon + outline + pulse (ring + "!"/"!!" glyph),
+# NEVER color alone; healthy nodes draw NOTHING (quiet at green — the
+# connected legs stay silent under flowing traffic).
+#
+# Verified surface (deterministic — same seed + commands reproduce it):
+#   tick 1 (50ms):   the pre-draw pile — residentials red (email spawns, no
+#                    routes yet) + the host AMBER (2 stuck = 75%) — the amber
+#                    pin.
+#   tick 200 (10s):  the host RED (the pile climbing) + the first growth-born
+#                    content_host red (spawned @t120, its streaming piles) +
+#                    the connected legs green.
+#   tick 400 (20s):  the host pile (pool-capped) red + growth content_hosts
+#                    red; the connected res->router legs stay GREEN (email
+#                    flows) — quiet where healthy. The host pipe draw lands
+#                    this tick (the recovery begins in the T1 tail).
+# Captures: 50ms / 10000ms / 20000ms.
+seed 4243
+era 3
+run 21000ms
+growth on
+fixture qos
+at 100ms draw 0 1 standard
+at 100ms draw 3 1 standard
+at 100ms draw 4 1 standard
+at 20000ms draw 1 2 standard
+capture at 50ms
+capture at 10000ms
+capture at 20000ms
+expect hash stable
